1
00:00:01,559 --> 00:00:03,080
[♪♪]

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,800
I'm Peppa Pig.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,920
This is my little brother,
George.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,119
[SNORTS]

5
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:10,479
This is Mommy Pig.
[SNORTS]

6
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:11,879
And this is Daddy Pig.

7
00:00:11,879 --> 00:00:13,320
[SNORTS]
[ALL LAUGH]

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,680
Peppa Pig.

9
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,920
[GRUNTS]

10
00:00:18,599 --> 00:00:20,200
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,720
NARRATOR:
Peppa and her family
are visiting

12
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:25,040
Uncle Pig and Auntie Pig
and Cousin Chloe.

13
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,680
I expect Uncle Pig
will fall asleep after lunch,

14
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,400
like he always does.

15
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,680
Daddy Pig, you shouldn't
say such things

16
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,879
about your own brother,

17
00:00:32,879 --> 00:00:34,960
especially in front
of the children.

18
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,160
But it's true.

19
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:38,480
Uncle Pig always eats
too much lunch

20
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:41,960
and falls asleep,
snoring loudly, like this:

21
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,519
[SNORING]

22
00:00:45,239 --> 00:00:47,120
[BOTH LAUGH]

23
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,120
DADDY PIG:
Uh, Peppa, George,

24
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,519
forget what I just said
about Uncle Pig.

25
00:00:51,519 --> 00:00:52,720
Okay, Daddy.

26
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,040
[GIGGLES]

27
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:56,000
[CAR HORN HONKS]

28
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,839
Peppa and her family
have arrived

29
00:00:57,839 --> 00:00:59,879
at Uncle Pig
and Auntie Pig's house.

30
00:00:59,879 --> 00:01:02,360
[SNORTS]
Hello, Auntie Pig and Uncle Pig.

31
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,680
[SNORTS]
Hello.

32
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:05,119
[SNORTS]
Hello, everyone.

33
00:01:05,119 --> 00:01:06,880
[SNORTS]
Hello, big brother.

34
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:09,119
Uncle Pig
is Daddy Pig's brother.

35
00:01:09,119 --> 00:01:11,759
Chloé Pig is Peppa
and George's cousin.

36
00:01:11,759 --> 00:01:13,039
Hello, Chloé.

37
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:14,520
[SNORTS]
Hello, Peppa.

38
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,880
Hello, George.

39
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:17,520
I want to show you
something.

40
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,360
Wait for us!
[KIDS GIGGLING]

41
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:24,839
This is my new
puppet theatre.

42
00:01:24,839 --> 00:01:27,360
My Daddy
made it for me.

43
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:29,399
Wow.
Ooh.

44
00:01:29,399 --> 00:01:31,800
I've made two puppets
already.

45
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,880
This one is called Chloé.

46
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:36,160
Hello. I am Chloé Pig.

47
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,360
[SNORTS]

48
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,520
[BOTH GIGGLE]

49
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,560
And this one
is my Daddy.

50
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,839
Uncle pig.

51
00:01:41,839 --> 00:01:44,759
Hello, Peppa.
I am Uncle Pig.

52
00:01:44,759 --> 00:01:46,039
[SNORTS]

53
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:47,360
[BOTH LAUGH]

54
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:51,000
Chloé, can me and George
make puppets too?

55
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,320
Yes.

56
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:56,399
Chloé paints
the puppet's eyes.

57
00:01:57,399 --> 00:02:00,240
Can I do the mouth?
Okay.

58
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,320
My name is Peppa.

59
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,839
[SNORTS]
[ALL LAUGH]

60
00:02:03,839 --> 00:02:06,720
George, what puppet
would you like to make?

61
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,960
Dinosaur!

62
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,639
A dinosaur?

63
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:13,720
George always says
dinosaur for everything.

64
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:17,120
Okay. A scary dinosaur puppet.

65
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:20,040
Chloé is making George
a dinosaur puppet.

66
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:22,160
[SNORTS]
It needs pointy teeth.

67
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,400
There.

68
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,519
A scary dinosaur.

69
00:02:25,519 --> 00:02:26,760
[LAUGHS]

70
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,440
Grrr.

71
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:30,040
[ALL GIGGLE]
[BELL DINGS]

72
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:32,400
AUNTIE PIG: Lunchtime, everyone.
Coming.

73
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,120
[SNORTS]
After lunch,

74
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,680
we'll do a puppet show..

75
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,440
Hooray!

76
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:41,640
Auntie Pig has made
spaghetti for lunch.

77
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:42,880
[SLURPS]

78
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:46,079
This spaghetti
is delicious.

79
00:02:46,079 --> 00:02:47,600
[SLURPS]

80
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,040
Best spaghetti ever.

81
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,200
You can tell you two
are brothers.

82
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:52,920
Alike in every way.

83
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,239
[SLURPING]

84
00:02:54,239 --> 00:02:55,519
What do you mean?

85
00:02:55,519 --> 00:02:56,679
[SLURPING]

86
00:02:56,679 --> 00:02:58,840
We are completely
different.

87
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,280
[ALL LAUGH]

88
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:04,600
Peppa, George and I are going
to do a puppet show.

89
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,880
Fantastic. Call us when
you're ready.

90
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,679
See you later.

91
00:03:08,679 --> 00:03:10,519
A puppet show.
That sounds fun.

92
00:03:10,519 --> 00:03:11,760
[SNORTS]

93
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,920
Have I got time
for some more spaghetti?

94
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,440
Could I have
some more too?

95
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:17,040
[ALL LAUGH]

96
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:21,640
The puppet show
is about to begin.

97
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:26,359
Hello, my name
is Chloé.

98
00:03:26,359 --> 00:03:28,320
And I am Peppa.

99
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,720
Grrr.

100
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:32,720
Aah! It's a dinosaur.

101
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:34,720
A scary dinosaur.
Eek!

102
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,480
[ROARS]

103
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,720
Oh, I say.
That's very good.

104
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,519
Bravo.

105
00:03:40,519 --> 00:03:42,000
I am Uncle Pig
[SNORTS]

106
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,600
Hello, Uncle Pig.
Hello, Peppa.

107
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,119
Ho, ho, ho.

108
00:03:46,119 --> 00:03:48,119
[LAUGHS]
It looks just like you.

109
00:03:48,119 --> 00:03:50,679
I think they've made my tummy
a bit big.

110
00:03:50,679 --> 00:03:53,679
Ho, ho. I did enjoy
my lunch.

111
00:03:53,679 --> 00:03:55,119
[ALL GIGGLE]

112
00:03:55,119 --> 00:03:58,760
Uncle Pig, are you going
to fall asleep

113
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:01,399
and snore
like you always do?

114
00:04:01,399 --> 00:04:03,280
What do you mean?

115
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:06,200
Daddy says you always
fall asleep

116
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:10,040
and snore loudly
like this.

117
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,000
[SNORTS]

118
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,560
[BOTH GASP]

119
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:16,000
[GIGGLING]

120
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,920
Ho, ho. Your daddy's right.
I do snore like this.

121
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:22,640
[SNORES]

122
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:25,320
Daddy Pig, you shouldn't
have said those things

123
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,760
about Uncle Pig.

124
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:29,440
I don't think Daddy Pig
or Uncle Pig can hear you.

125
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,719
[BOTH SNORING]
Daddy Pig and Uncle Pig

126
00:04:31,719 --> 00:04:32,840
have fallen asleep.

127
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,840
You can tell
they're brothers.

128
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,159
[ALL LAUGH]

129
00:04:36,159 --> 00:04:37,479
Eh? What happened?

130
00:04:37,479 --> 00:04:38,719
[SNORTS]
Huh?

131
00:04:38,719 --> 00:04:40,599
Has the puppet show
started yet?

132
00:04:40,599 --> 00:04:42,080
[ALL LAUGH]

133
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:52,919
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

134
00:04:52,919 --> 00:04:57,400
NARRATOR:
Mommy Pig is watching a
keep-fit program on television.

135
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,960
Come on, now.
That's right.

136
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:01,240
Bend it, stretch it,
bend it, stretch it.

137
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,520
[SIGHS]

138
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:04,640
I love watching telly.

139
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,159
What's this Mommy Pig?

140
00:05:06,159 --> 00:05:09,760
It's a program about doing
exercises to keep fit.

141
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,039
[LAUGHS]

142
00:05:11,039 --> 00:05:13,320
Thank goodness
I don't have to exercise.

143
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,520
I'm naturally fit.

144
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:17,039
You don't look
very fit, Daddy.

145
00:05:17,039 --> 00:05:19,440
Your tummy
is a bit big.

146
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,719
I'm very fit.
I'll show you.

147
00:05:21,719 --> 00:05:23,520
[SNORTS]
What shall I do first?

148
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:26,599
Touch your toes
like this.

149
00:05:26,599 --> 00:05:28,200
Easy.

150
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:30,120
[STRAINING]

151
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:33,800
Daddy, stop pretending that
you can't touch your toes.

152
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:36,640
Uh, I'm not
pretending, Peppa.

153
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:39,560
NARRATOR:
Daddy Pig really cannot
touch his toes.

154
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,120
Oh, dear, Daddy.

155
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,840
That's not very good.

156
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:46,440
Hmm, maybe I should do
a bit of exercise.

157
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:47,760
Yes, Daddy.

158
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:50,560
And I will start...
tomorrow.

159
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,840
MOMMY PIG:
Daddy Pig!

160
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:54,240
You have to start
exercising now!

161
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,520
Oh.

162
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:58,320
Don't worry, Daddy.
I will help you.

163
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,000
Oh, all right.

164
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,320
Peppa, you're in charge
of getting me fit.

165
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:04,159
What should I do first?
[SNORTS]

166
00:06:04,159 --> 00:06:06,760
First you must do
some press-ups.

167
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,479
[SNORTS]
Easy.

168
00:06:09,599 --> 00:06:11,760
One, two...

169
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:14,200
There.
Very good, Daddy.

170
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:16,400
Now I want you to do...

171
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,799
100.

172
00:06:17,799 --> 00:06:19,479
One hundred?

173
00:06:19,479 --> 00:06:20,880
Yes.

174
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:23,280
Come on, children.
Help me make lunch.

175
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,560
I'll help as well.

176
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,719
No, Daddy.

177
00:06:25,719 --> 00:06:28,680
You've got 100 press-ups
to do.

178
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,880
Oh.

179
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,520
One.
[GIGGLES]

180
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,120
Two.

181
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:35,440
Three...

182
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:38,599
Mommy Pig, Peppa and George are
in the kitchen making lunch.

183
00:06:38,599 --> 00:06:40,840
Daddy Pig is still
doing his press-ups.

184
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:43,000
Daddy is doing
very well.

185
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,680
DADDY PIG:
...Nine...10...

186
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:47,719
Yes, I do hope he's not
overdoing it.

187
00:06:47,719 --> 00:06:48,919
I'll go and see.

188
00:06:48,919 --> 00:06:50,200
DADDY PIG:
...13,

189
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:54,320
14, 15, 16,

190
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,039
17...

191
00:06:56,039 --> 00:06:58,680
Daddy Pig!
You're cheating!

192
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,840
You should be doing
press-ups.

193
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:04,400
Oh. Uh, there was something
interesting on the TV.

194
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,919
Naughty Daddy.

195
00:07:05,919 --> 00:07:07,799
Maybe Daddy will have
more success

196
00:07:07,799 --> 00:07:09,560
with my old
exercise bike.

197
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,799
Ah-ha. This looks like fun.
[BELL DINGS]

198
00:07:11,799 --> 00:07:15,599
I'll be able to cycle
and watch TV at the same time.

199
00:07:15,599 --> 00:07:17,880
[CRANKING LOUDLY]

200
00:07:18,799 --> 00:07:20,520
It's impossible.

201
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,039
This bike is too noisy.

202
00:07:22,039 --> 00:07:23,840
I can't hear the TV.

203
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,159
You've got to get fit
somehow.

204
00:07:26,159 --> 00:07:27,320
I know!

205
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,680
You can use
my bicycle.

206
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:32,719
Yes, and then you'll get
some fresh air as well.

207
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:37,320
Daddy Pig is going to ride
on Peppa's little bicycle.

208
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,479
Daddy, these are
the pedals.

209
00:07:39,479 --> 00:07:41,280
These are the brakes.

210
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,239
And this is the bell.
[BELL DINGS]

211
00:07:43,239 --> 00:07:45,120
Yes, yes. Thank you Peppa.
I know.

212
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,719
[SNORTS]
Bye-bye.

213
00:07:46,719 --> 00:07:48,200
[BELL DINGS]

214
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:50,400
Easy as pie.

215
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,200
[PANTING]

216
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,640
Getting fit
is quite hard work.

217
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,280
[SIGHS]

218
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:58,679
[BELL DINGS]
[LAUGHS]

219
00:07:58,679 --> 00:08:01,520
Now I can get fit
without having to pedal.

220
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,919
Daddy Pig is going
very fast.

221
00:08:03,919 --> 00:08:06,719
Oh, maybe I'd better
slow down.

222
00:08:06,719 --> 00:08:08,359
[BRAKES SQUEAL]
Aah!

223
00:08:08,359 --> 00:08:10,239
The brakes aren't
strong enough.

224
00:08:10,239 --> 00:08:12,840
Help! Aah!
[BELL DINGING]

225
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:15,120
[QUACKING]

226
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,719
Whoa!

227
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:22,120
[QUACKING]

228
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:25,599
Daddy Pig has been gone
for a long time.

229
00:08:25,599 --> 00:08:28,000
Mommy, where can
Daddy be?

230
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,359
Don't worry, Peppa...

231
00:08:29,359 --> 00:08:31,560
Daddy must be really
enjoying himself

232
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,840
to be away for so long.

233
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:36,360
[PANTING]

234
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,280
[QUACKING]

235
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,520
[BELL DINGING]

236
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:42,240
Daddy! Where have
you been?

237
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:44,600
I whizzed all the way
down the hill,

238
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:47,400
then I had to push the bike
all the way back up again.

239
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,640
Oh, poor Daddy Pig.

240
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:52,199
Well, at least I've done
my exercise.

241
00:08:52,199 --> 00:08:54,640
Yes. For today.
What do you mean?

242
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:56,840
You have to do more exercise
tomorrow.

243
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,720
What?

244
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:03,199
Daddy, to get fit you have
to exercise every day.

245
00:09:03,199 --> 00:09:05,120
Oh, no.

246
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:08,880
But don't worry, Daddy.
I'll make sure you do it.

247
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,959
Yes. I know you will.

248
00:09:10,959 --> 00:09:12,240
[CHUCKLES]

249
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,240
[ALL LAUGH]

250
00:09:21,439 --> 00:09:24,319
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

251
00:09:24,319 --> 00:09:27,199
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George
are in their bedroom

252
00:09:27,199 --> 00:09:28,720
playing with their toys.

253
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:32,600
George, let's play
dollies and dinosaurs

254
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,319
[SNORTING]
Grrr!

255
00:09:34,319 --> 00:09:35,720
[BOTH LAUGH]

256
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,560
What is that?

257
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:40,120
It looks like
a horrible monster.

258
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:42,720
Dinosaur. Grrr.

259
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:45,959
Aah! It's a dinosaur!

260
00:09:45,959 --> 00:09:47,760
Help! Help!

261
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:50,160
[IMITATING DINOSAUR ROARING]
[SCREAMS]

262
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,720
Help! Help!

263
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:56,400
Daddy Pig is in the sitting
room reading his newspaper.

264
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,880
